      "id": "botchan-s03-p0002",
      "source_en": "Going with a chalk box to the classroom from the teachers' room at the second hour gave me a feeling as if I were riding into a hostile land. Entering the room, I found that it was composed of lads much bigger than those in the other room. Being a Yedo man of small and delicate build, I could not make a commanding figure even on an elevated platform. I would not shrink from fighting a wrestler if opportunity demanded so doing, but I have neither skill nor art to intimidate with an exercise of the tongue those big boys, forty in",
